ormanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":68,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-10-14T09:12:18Z","updated_at":"2017-01-12T11:35:43Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2017-01-12T11:35:43Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-12-15T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2016-12-21T08:57:46Z","closed_at":"2016-12-20T09:32:00Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Running Netty on a Java-VM on IBM z/OS leads to unnecessary warnings.\r\n\r\nYou have to know that Unix System Services of IBM z/OS offers PIDs greater than 2^22, as assumed in DefaultChannelID (see Issue 2706)\r\n\r\n`   Welcome to  Unix System Services ZOSU of`      \r\n          ` z / O S   Version 2 Release 2`            \r\n`$ ps`\r\n      `PID TTY       TIME CMD`\r\n     `   41 ttyp0000  0:00 /bin/sh`\r\n ` 50332311 ttyp0000  0:00 /bin/ps`    <== !\r\n`$`\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nNetty should accept valid PIDs coming from any OS. It is a little bit infelicitous to assume that the Linux64 limits are valid for all OS which supports JAVA.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nEven DefaultChannelID's auto-mechanism succeeded in detecting the correct PID on z/OS the PID is discarded by later check and replaced by a random value.\r\n\r\n`Dec 15, 2016 6:05:49 AM io.netty.channel.DefaultChannelId defaultProcessId                  \r\nWARNING: Failed to find the current process ID from '50332208'; using a random value: 474712`\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\nStart any Netty-using application (i.e. your sample io.netty.example.echo.EchoServer) on IBM Mainframe z/OS. With a little luck the arising PID violates the limit in Netty.\r\n\r\n### Minimal yet complete reproducer code (or URL to code)\r\nio.netty.example.echo.EchoServer\r\n\r\n### Netty version\r\n4.1.5\r\n\r\n### JVM version (e.g. `java -version`)\r\njava version \"1.7.0\"\r\nJava(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build pmz3170_27sr3fp40-20160422_01(SR3 FP40))\r\nIBM J9 VM (build 2.7, JRE 1.7.0 z/OS s390-31 20160406_298393 (JIT enabled, AOT enabled)\r\nJ9VM - R27_Java727_SR3_20160406_0942_B298393\r\nJIT  - tr.r13.java_20160328_114186\r\nGC   - R27_Java727_SR3_20160406_0942_B298393\r\nJ9CL - 20160406_298393)\r\nJCL - 20160421_01 based on Oracle jdk7u101-b14\r\n\r\n### OS version (e.g. `uname -a`)\r\nIBM z/OS 2.2\r\n$ uname -a\r\nOS/390 ZOSU 25.00 04 2828\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/6134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/6134/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}